# Read by src/data/demoCap.ts. Loaded ONLY by `npm run build:demo` (Vite's
# --mode demo loads .env.demo in addition to .env) — the ordinary "build"
# and "electron:build" scripts never see this file, which is the entire
# mechanism keeping the demo cap out of the paid/Electron build.
#
# Business Plan v1 §2b/§13, decision 1 (11 Sep 2026): Act I, Warden
# Company, missions 1-12, plus the Hub. 12 is a position in
# WARDEN_MISSION_CHAIN (data/allCampaigns.ts), not a raw mission count —
# see data/demoCap.ts's own comment. House Amaranth is locked out entirely
# regardless of this number.
VITE_DEMO_MISSION_CAP=12